<p>Notes on differentials:</p>
<p>--Effective May 27, 1997, LAG and TXG corn and soybean differentials must be adjusted as follows: All differentials add -10 cents.</p>
<p>--Effective May 27, 1997, LAG and TXG sorghum differentials must be adjusted as follows: All differentials add -20 cents/CWT.</p>
<p>--Effective May 27, 1997, differentials for PNW corn should be adjusted as follows -- All differentials add -10 cents.</p>
